Package: OmniSeq
Title: Multi-Omics RNA-Seq Analysis with Transposable Element Integration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given   = "Nizar",
    family  = "Berrim",
    role    = c("aut", "cre"),
    email   = "nizarberrim.geno@gmail.com"
  )
Description: OmniSeq provides a unified workflow for bulk RNA-seq differential
    expression analysis, pathway enrichment, transposable element analysis,
    and multi-omics integration. It supports gene and TE count matrices,
    wraps DESeq2, clusterProfiler, GSVA, WGCNA, mixOmics, decoupleR, and
    immunedeconv into a single coherent S3 object-based interface. Key
    features include innate immune sensor scoring from TE expression data,
    causal mediation analysis, and export to publication-ready tables and
    figures.
